        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F' }}>②</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>线圈互感：两只空心线圈间距未定，k = −0.03 时带宽升至 3.0 MHz、抑制降到 −5.6 dB</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F' }}>③</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>供货：BAT85 直插封装已停产、132-17L 查无现货，需先验证替代料</Text>
